  "projects": [
   {
    "title": "Scarletshield: A Lightweight, Linux-based Network Security Solution Suite",
    "description": "Scarletshield is an undergraduate senior ECE Capstone Design project which utilized a server box connected to a switch network dedicated to monitoring and ensuring security of all web traffic. \n\nUsing a Ubuntu 12.04 LTS Server with Snort, barnyard2 and fail2ban, suspicious activities were reported and stored in a MySQL database that was then used for a web-based front-end called the Scarletshield Suite. I led efforts on the front-end which took data from the database, analyzed it and created ways to interact with it so that patterns may be drawn. \n\nFrom the PDF provided, Chapter 4 represents a good portion of my work with the exception of the login page.",
